{"4602770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tower of Genn", "steam_appid": 4602770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Behold: the great Tower of Genn!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A monument of prosperity for all who gather here. The great people of Genn need YOU as their Royal Engineer to keep their legacy of intellectuals intact. Build and grow carefully, for the future is not as certain as it seems. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the engineer of your tower as you climb ever upwards, strategically employing special blocks in order to complete quests and maintain your stockpile. Take careful attention not to harm the nature that begins to call your tower home! There is more to this world than growth: there is maintenance, and there is harmony. For Genn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4602770/extras/274777ff747ee1a29bd26fb88df6bd74.avif?t=1787648438\" width=1200 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4602770/extras/8ca2c4777a49397616de86f06647bd34.poster.avif?t=1787648438\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4602770/extras/8ca2c4777a49397616de86f06647bd34.webm?t=1787648438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4602770/extras/8ca2c4777a49397616de86f06647bd34.mp4?t=1787648438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your tower for as long as possible before the forces of nature overwhelm you. No need to stress, however! Each move will show you where a piece will fit and wait for you to act. There is no timer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4602770/extras/670627612aeecabeda53fa9697abb4cf.avif?t=1787648438\" width=1200 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4602770/extras/882adc9882435a4dd11de1cf53f7dcf6.poster.avif?t=1787648438\" width=1170 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4602770/extras/882adc9882435a4dd11de1cf53f7dcf6.webm?t=1787648438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4602770/extras/882adc9882435a4dd11de1cf53f7dcf6.mp4?t=1787648438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special blocks, each with their own properties and behaviors, can be combined to initiate game-changing interactions. Some may be obvious, and some may be surprising! Score as much as possible by chaining interactions in a single turn, and play strategically in order to maintain your stockpile. With more than 10 special blocks, they are both rewarding and punishing: be careful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4602770/extras/6f62466ced31d1ce77e3129af7d5dc5c.avif?t=1787648438\" width=1200 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4602770/extras/f67f28a20bbcb47ddbaa09500578561f.poster.avif?t=1787648438\" width=1170 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4602770/extras/f67f28a20bbcb47ddbaa09500578561f.webm?t=1787648438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4602770/extras/f67f28a20bbcb47ddbaa09500578561f.mp4?t=1787648438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, quests may appear throughout your building journey! Complete these in order to continue ascending as long as possible, as they will be vital to the survival of your people and its legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Behold: the great Tower of Genn!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A monument of prosperity for all who gather here. The great people of Genn need YOU as their Royal Engineer to keep their legacy of intellectuals intact. Build and grow carefully, for the future is not as certain as it seems. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the engineer of your tower as you climb ever upwards, strategically employing special blocks in order to complete quests and maintain your stockpile. Take careful attention not to harm the nature that begins to call your tower home! There is more to this world than growth: there is maintenance, and there is harmony. For Genn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4602770/extras/274777ff747ee1a29bd26fb88df6bd74.avif?t=1787648438\" width=1200 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati