 strategically in order to maintain your stockpile. With more than 10 special blocks, they are both rewarding and punishing: be careful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4602770/extras/6f62466ced31d1ce77e3129af7d5dc5c.avif?t=1787648438\" width=1200 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4602770/extras/f67f28a20bbcb47ddbaa09500578561f.poster.avif?t=1787648438\" width=1170 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4602770/extras/f67f28a20bbcb47ddbaa09500578561f.webm?t=1787648438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4602770/extras/f67f28a20bbcb47ddbaa09500578561f.mp4?t=1787648438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, quests may appear throughout your building journey! Complete these in order to continue ascending as long as possible, as they will be vital to the survival of your people and its legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Tower of Genn is a puzzle-strategy building game where you construct a precarious Tower using an expansive variety of pieces. Fulfill quests, discover new interactions with special blocks, and uncover the history behind the sacred people of Genn.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4602770/1f80ffabe22ef96721c9218117811643c6b69cc9/header.jpg?t=1787648438", "capsule_image": "https://shared